  pages:
  - heading: Hourglass TEST #14
    body: 'Still losing too much time between turns.


      If I can get it working
      properly, I should be able to return everything to the exact position it was
      in before.


      DO NOT ABANDON THIS, SANTIAGO!!'
  - heading: Returned Letter
    body: 'Santiago,


      Francisco called me again asking about you and Daisy.
      I told him that whatever is happening between the three of you, I don''t want
      to be dragged into it. He sounded angry.


      Call me when you get this.
      I mean it.


      Alberto'
  description: 
  detectiveLine: Hm?
